s used it for a variety of purposes."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d01", "start": 341, "end": 419, "text": "It was listed on the National Register of Historic Places on October 28, 1970."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d01", "start": 420, "end": 564, "text": "The Deshon-Allyn House is located on the campus of the Lyman Allyn Art Museum on the east side of Williams Street, north of downtown New London."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d01", "start": 565, "end": 567, "text": "It"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d02", "start": 0, "end": 62, "text": "young Daniel had married in 1820 Augusta , the daughter of Dr."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d02", "start": 63, "end": 103, "text": "Thomas Coit , who died two years later ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d02", "start": 104, "end": 249, "text": "For his second wife he chose Fanny , the daughter of Senator George Thurston of Hopkinton , Rhode Island , and they were married in July , 1826 ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d02", "start": 250, "end": 414, "text": "The old Bolles house very likely proved inadequate for the entertaining which the daughter of a Senator would do , and in 1829 the present stone mansion was built ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d02", "start": 415, "end": 526, "text": "It is regrettable that there is nothing to indicate the name of the architect responsible for the house , since"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d03", "start": 0, "end": 4, "text": ", m."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0215-a275bbc6e265:d03", "start": 5, "end": 44, "text": "( styled 3d ) Mehitable Locke , 2 Mar ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-02